{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-67812","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-129146","text":"FleetPrompt — The Open Agent Marketplace"}]},{"id":"blk-67813","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129147","text":"Discover, publish, and install production-ready AI agents. Built on trust scores, versioned manifests, and one-click deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-67814","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-129148","text":"The landing page is GENERATED. Do not hand-edit "},{"id":"spn-129149","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-129150","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-67815","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129151","marks":["code"],"text":"/index.html"},{"id":"spn-129152","text":", "},{"id":"spn-129153","marks":["code"],"text":"/replay.js"},{"id":"spn-129154","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-129155","marks":["code"],"text":"/form.js"},{"id":"spn-129156","text":" are emitted by "},{"id":"spn-129157","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-129158","text":" from "},{"id":"spn-129159","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json"},{"id":"spn-129160","text":", "},{"id":"spn-129161","marks":["code"],"text":"src/landing.html"},{"id":"spn-129162","text":", "},{"id":"spn-129163","marks":["code"],"text":"src/shell.css"},{"id":"spn-129164","text":", "},{"id":"spn-129165","marks":["code"],"text":"src/replay.js"},{"id":"spn-129166","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-129167","marks":["code"],"text":"src/form.js"},{"id":"spn-129168","text":". "},{"id":"spn-129169","marks":["bold"],"text":"An edit to the served HTML is silently reverted by the next build."},{"id":"spn-129170","text":" Change the record or the template."}]},{"id":"blk-67816","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"./site.sh     # run the suite(s), emit the site, run the publication gate"},{"id":"blk-67817","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129171","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-129172","text":" does not quote a test count — it "},{"id":"spn-129173","marks":["bold"],"text":"executes"},{"id":"spn-129174","text":" the suite, parses what the runner prints, and refuses to emit anything if a number has moved off "},{"id":"spn-129175","marks":["code"],"text":"records/tests.json"},{"id":"spn-129176","text":". That is how the count on this page stopped being a thing anyone could type."}]},{"id":"blk-67818","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129177","marks":["code"],"text":"launch-gate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-129178","text":" reads the emitted artifact and refuses to publish when it and the records disagree: a retracted claim reinstated, a rung invented, a CTA the rung has not earned, an unrendered token, a "},{"id":"spn-129179","marks":["code"],"text":"mailto:"},{"id":"spn-129180","text":" or an email address, a text token below 4.5:1, a same-origin link that resolves to nothing, an artifact that is not what this build emitted, an identifying-animation constant leaking into the copy, or a button whose colour is decided by a non-button rule. "},{"id":"spn-129181","marks":["bold"],"text":"It prints its own total"},{"id":"spn-129182","text":" &mdash; 124 on 2026-08-17, and that figure is the only one in this repository that is not derived, which is why it carries a date. "},{"id":"spn-129183","marks":["bold"],"text":"Do not hand-type a check count anywhere:"},{"id":"spn-129184","text":" it went from 92 to 124 in a single session, and a typed count is exactly how a printed number and a published one drift apart."}]},{"id":"blk-67819","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129185","text":"Built against "},{"id":"spn-129186","marks":["bold"],"text":"`shell-r9`"},{"id":"spn-129187","text":", recorded as "},{"id":"spn-129188","marks":["code"],"text":"shell_revision"},{"id":"spn-129189","text":" in "},{"id":"spn-129190","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json"},{"id":"spn-129191","text":". The whole shell is documented in "},{"id":"spn-129192","marks":["code"],"text":"ProjectAmp2/agents/SHELL.md"},{"id":"spn-129193","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-67820","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129194","marks":["bold"],"text":"The band says \"a specification in the ComputeDriven world\", not \"the distribution layer of ComputeDriven\", and that is deliberate."},{"id":"spn-129195","text":" "},{"id":"spn-129196","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand-nav"},{"id":"spn-129197","text":" records this domain as "},{"id":"spn-129198","marks":["code"],"text":"place: 3"},{"id":"spn-129199","text":", whose "},{"id":"spn-129200","marks":["code"],"text":"renderPlacement()"},{"id":"spn-129201","text":" gives the layer sentence to "},{"id":"spn-129202","marks":["code"],"text":"place: 2"},{"id":"spn-129203","text":" only. The old eyebrow claimed the layer and is now blocklisted."}]},{"id":"blk-67821","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129204","marks":["bold"],"text":"Contact is the Formspree endpoint ruled by Travis (SHELL.md r9)"},{"id":"spn-129205","text":", as a real "},{"id":"spn-129206","marks":["code"],"text":"<form>"},{"id":"spn-129207","text":" that posts with scripting off; "},{"id":"spn-129208","marks":["code"],"text":"src/form.js"},{"id":"spn-129209","text":" only upgrades it to an inline reply and prints success solely on a 2xx. No "},{"id":"spn-129210","marks":["code"],"text":"mailto:"},{"id":"spn-129211","text":" anywhere."}]},{"id":"blk-67822","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-129212","text":"Source-of-truth spec"}]},{"id":"blk-67823","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-67825","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129213","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-129214","text":" — FleetPrompt technical specification"}]}],"id":"blk-67824","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-67827","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129215","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/BUILD.md"},{"id":"spn-129216","text":" — Implementation build prompt (9 phases)"}]}],"id":"blk-67826","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-67828","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-129217","text":"Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-67829","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8 (LiveView for UI, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migrations 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-67830","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-129218","text":"Build commands"}]},{"id":"blk-67831","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"mix deps.get\nmix compile --warnings-as-errors\nmix format --check-formatted\nmix test                          # requires running Supabase for DB tests\nmix test test/fleet_prompt/       # unit tests (no DB required for most)"},{"id":"blk-67832","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-129219","text":"Key modules"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-67834","spans":[{"id":"spn-129220","text":"Module"}]},{"id":"blk-67835","spans":[{"id":"spn-129221","text":"Purpose"}]}],"id":"blk-67833","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-67836","spans":[{"id":"spn-129222","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Registry"}]},{"id":"blk-67837","spans":[{"id":"spn-129223","text":"Agent + manifest CRUD, version immutability, status transitions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67838","spans":[{"id":"spn-129224","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Engine"}]},{"id":"blk-67839","spans":[{"id":"spn-129225","text":"4-signal weighted trust computation (test 30%, spec 25%, usage 25%, audit 20%)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67840","spans":[{"id":"spn-129226","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Worker"}]},{"id":"blk-67841","spans":[{"id":"spn-129227","text":"GenServer per agent — recomputes, caches in ETS, broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67842","spans":[{"id":"spn-129228","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Supervisor"}]},{"id":"blk-67843","spans":[{"id":"spn-129229","text":"DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67844","spans":[{"id":"spn-129230","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search"}]},{"id":"blk-67845","spans":[{"id":"spn-129231","text":"pg_trgm + ts_vector full-text search with filters"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67846","spans":[{"id":"spn-129232","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Forks"}]},{"id":"blk-67847","spans":[{"id":"spn-129233","text":"Fork-and-customize with provenance tracking"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67848","spans":[{"id":"spn-129234","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake"}]},{"id":"blk-67849","spans":[{"id":"spn-129235","text":"ConsolidationEvent processing from Agentelic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67850","spans":[{"id":"spn-129236","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.InstallEngine"}]},{"id":"blk-67851","spans":[{"id":"spn-129237","text":"Install flow with permission checks"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67852","spans":[{"id":"spn-129238","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.AuditWriter"}]},{"id":"blk-67853","spans":[{"id":"spn-129239","text":"Append-only audit event recording"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67854","spans":[{"id":"spn-129240","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher"}]},{"id":"blk-67855","spans":[{"id":"spn-129241","text":"Oban worker for async webhook delivery"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67856","spans":[{"id":"spn-129242","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Cache"}]},{"id":"blk-67857","spans":[{"id":"spn-129243","text":"ETS GenServer with 4 named tables"}]}],[{"id":"blk-67858","spans":[{"id":"spn-129244","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.MCP.Server"}]},{"id":"blk-67859","spans":[{"id":"spn-129245","text":"MCP JSON-RPC server (7 tools)"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-67860","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-129246","text":"Supabase schema"}]},{"id":"blk-67861","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129247","text":"Tables live in "},{"id":"spn-129248","marks":["code"],"tex